# rss.golfj — the Golf port of rss.py (W14-B), same command line and output:
#   rss INFILE CMD ARGS...   run CMD with INFILE on stdin and stdout on
#                            /dev/null; print its peak RSS in KB (wait4's
#                            ru_maxrss), one line.  stderr is inherited and
#                            the exit status is ignored, as in rss.py.
# tools/golfc -j bench/leetcode/rss.golfj rss && ./rss in/stock.txt bin/stock
